WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.415 --> 00:00:02.000
I did everything right

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.500
I worked hard

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.400
I played according to the rules

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:07.400
I was kind as often as anyone can be

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:08.900
I led a good, Decent life

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.900
Why then I am lying here on the hospital bed

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:12.900
With my house destroyed, and my life on the edge

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.900
Of being a life anymore

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.900
I was

